{"id":"2e434343f51a33e9","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-weak2-ml.md","title":"弱 2 随机性蕴含 Martin-Löf 随机性","display":"thm-weak2-ml — 弱 2 随机性蕴含 Martin-Löf 随机性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-weak2-ml","aliases":["43-thm-weak2-ml"],"display":"thm-weak2-ml — 弱 2 随机性蕴含 Martin-Löf 随机性","depends_on":["[[43-df-weak2random]]","[[43-df-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-genmltest]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§9.3.2 strong randomness讨论，印刷178，PDF198","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-weak2-ml"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-weak2-ml</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-weak2-ml — 弱 2 随机性蕴含 Martin-Löf 随机性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1a145b88092ce22e\" href=\"?note=1a145b88092ce22e\" title=\"43-df-weak2random\">43-df-weak2random</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"324aa8987ee8eac3\" href=\"?note=324aa8987ee8eac3\" title=\"43-df-genmltest\">43-df-genmltest</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§9.3.2 strong randomness讨论，印刷178，PDF198"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；定义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1a145b88092ce22e\" href=\"?note=1a145b88092ce22e\" title=\"43-df-weak2random\">43-df-weak2random</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"324aa8987ee8eac3\" href=\"?note=324aa8987ee8eac3\" title=\"43-df-genmltest\">43-df-genmltest</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Weak2Random}\">\\(\\mathrm{Weak2Random}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1a145b88092ce22e\" href=\"?note=1a145b88092ce22e\" title=\"43-df-weak2random\">43-df-weak2random</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Weak2Random}(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Weak2Random}(X)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个ML检验都是广义ML检验，直接展开。</p>\n<p>来源：§9.3.2 strong randomness讨论，印刷178，PDF198。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-weak2random","status":"resolved","id":"1a145b88092ce22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","ex